      "message": "I\u0027ll spend some time tinkering with different ways to do this, but I don\u0027t think we really want just anyone to be able to set things on glyphs just whenever, will need to think a bit about the invariants we need.",
      "revId": "dae51f0fbc249c1a43399787172bc4c0b4094f07",
